{"status":"success","message":null,"data":{"responsibilities":null,"overview":null,"locations":"Bangalore","processCompleted":false,"deleted":false,"mailPublished":true,"newCompany":false,"dream":false,"notificationMuted":true,"applied":false,"studentOopsOrFrozen":false,"modifyAllowed":false,"withdrawAllowed":false,"withdrawalDeadlineSameAsApplicationDeadline":false,"displayNameSameAsCompanyName":true,"includedInApplicationMatrix":false,"application_detail_id":6247,"application_id":1251,"application_status_id":3,"placement_process_id":44,"batch_group_id":0,"batch_group_ids":"[60, 59]","dayslot_id":0,"cluster_id":0,"cluster_sequence_number":0,"job_function_id":0,"uuid":"ba8a25cb-ff33-4fed-907f-4622d4d48f5a","sector_id":66,"company_id":816,"max_roles_to_be_applied":0,"company_name":"GlobalFoundries","job_title":"CAD Software Engineer - IC Design","sector_label":"VLSI and Semiconductors","other_sector":"","max_roles":0,"job_summary":"","job_function":"","job_description":"","process_name":"FT 2025-26","batch_group_label":"","skills":"Strong programming experience in Python, Java, and/or C.\nKnowledge of multithreading and multiprocessing concepts.\nBasic understanding of EDA flows.","website_url":"https://www.gf.com/","eligibility_information":"M.Tech from Computer Science / Electronics ","job_package":"","min_work_experience":0,"max_work_experience":0,"is_dream":false,"date_of_visit":null,"publish_time":1776926211000,"withdrawl_deadline":1777861800000,"application_deadline":1777861800000,"application_start_time":1776926246000,"additional_information":"<b>Title:</b> CAD Software Engineer - IC Design<div><br><div><b>About GlobalFoundries&#10;</b></div><div><b><br></b></div><div>GlobalFoundries is a leading full-service semiconductor foundry providing a unique combination of design, development, and fabrication services to some of the world&#8217;s most inspired technology companies. With a global manufacturing footprint spanning three continents, GlobalFoundries makes possible the technologies and systems that transform industries and give customers the power to shape their markets. For more information, visit www.gf.com&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Introduction: &#10;</b></div><div>We are seeking a highly motivated EDA Flow Automation Engineer with strong programming skills and a solid understanding of EDA and IP design flows. The role involves automating EDA flows using logical problem&#8209;solving and AI tools, implementing unified generation and QA flows for all IPs, and owning the complete software lifecycle from requirement gathering to deployment.&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Your Job:&#10;</b></div><div>EDA flow Automation using logical skills and AI tools&#10;</div><div>Handle software applications from requirement gathering to deployment&#10;</div><div>Take responsibility and drive the activities&#10;</div><div>Debug the Environment and software related issues&#10;</div><div>Test cases creation and CI/CD for seamless release process&#10;</div><div>EDA tool installations and CAD operation work&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Other Responsibilities: &#10;</b></div><div>Perform all activities in a safe and responsible manner and support all Environmental, Health, Safety &amp; Security requirements and programs&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Required Qualifications:&#10;</b></div><div>Education M.E/M.TECH Equivalent degree in Computer Science/Electronics&#10;</div><div>Years of Experience: 0 to 1 year&#10;</div><div><br></div><div><b>Preferred Qualifications: &#10;</b></div><div>Strong programming experience in Python, Java, and/or C.&#10;</div><div>Knowledge of multithreading and multiprocessing concepts.&#10;</div><div>Basic understanding of EDA flows.&#10;</div><div>Understanding of FIP flows, including Logic and Memory flows.&#10;</div><div>Having debugging skills to track environment or software issues&#10;</div><div><br></div><div>#NCGProgramIND&#10;</div><div><br></div><div>GlobalFoundries is an equal opportunity employer, cultivating a diverse and inclusive workforce. We believe having a multicultural workplace enhances productivity, efficiency and innovation whilst our employees feel truly respected, valued and heard.&#10;</div><div>As an affirmative employer, all qualified applicants are considered for employment regardless of age, ethnicity, marital status, citizenship, race, religion, political affiliation, gender, sexual orientation and medical and/or physical abilities.&#10;</div><div>All offers of employment with GlobalFoundries are conditioned upon the successful completion of background checks, medical screenings as applicable and subject to the respective local laws and regulations.</div></div>","additional_details":null,"is_notification_muted":true,"is_withdrawal_same_as_application_deadline":false,"is_new_company":false,"is_display_name_same_as_company_name":true,"is_included_in_application_matrix":false,"display_name":"GlobalFoundries","is_published":true,"is_deleted":false,"is_process_completed":false,"created_by":9851,"created_by_name":"Jijo Aliyas","updated_by":9940,"created_at":1776923095000,"updated_at":1777456549000,"company_query":{"overview":null,"city":null,"state":null,"zip":null,"pan":null,"contacts":null,"sourceHistory":null,"placecoms":null,"approved":false,"company_id":816,"company_name":"GlobalFoundries","source":null,"website_url":null,"logo":null,"industry":null,"address_line_1":null,"address_line_2":null,"is_approved":false,"is_disabled":false,"primary_placecoms":null,"secondary_placecoms":null,"created_by":8524,"updated_by":8524,"created_at":1760341820000,"updated_at":1760341820000},"questions":[{"mcqOptions":null,"mcqId":0,"answer":null,"answered":false,"question_id":911,"application_id":1251,"question_type_id":7,"question":"Do you relevant Skills in Python Automation","is_mandatory":true,"options":"Yes,No","min_select":null,"max_select":null,"is_deleted":false,"created_by":9940,"updated_by":9940,"created_at":1777456498000,"choices":